WEBVTT

00:12:30.913 --> 00:12:35.685
You have the power to help someone
by imagining more than two boxes,

00:12:35.718 --> 00:12:37.120
male or female.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:41.257
You have the power
to create safe environments

00:12:41.291 --> 00:12:45.828
where whichever box they check
isn't the most important part of somebody.

00:12:46.496 --> 00:12:50.566
You have the power
to educate others and yourself.

00:12:51.067 --> 00:12:54.304
You have the power to bridge those gaps.

00:12:55.305 --> 00:12:57.540
You have the power.

00:12:58.641 --> 00:12:59.809
Thank you.

00:12:59.842 --> 00:13:03.079
(Applause)